+    architecture: it composes the Qwen4-Exp language backbone and LM head the way
+    the multimodal entry's language path does, but never allocates a vision
+    tower, never builds an MTP/draft head, and accepts only text-prefixed
+    checkpoint tensors (visual/MTP names raise). Loading routes through the same
+    Qwen4ExpWeightLoadMixin path as LIL, so the PLE handling exists once.
